se, the Peter == first clue means the Peter is the very short person.", "S9: very_short == 1."], "solution": {"header": ["House", "Name", "Height"], "rows": [["1", "Peter", "very_tall"], ["2", "Bob", "tall"], ["3", "Alice", "average"], ["4", "Eric", "very_tall"], ["5", "Carol", "tall"], ["6", "Arnold", "very_short"]]}}
