se, and the person who is Alice is in the fifth house, the person who is Carol must be in the second house.", "S10: Carol == 2."], "solution": {"header": ["House", "Name", "Height"], "rows": [["1", "Peter", "average"], ["2", "Carol", "tall"], ["3", "Alice", "tall"], ["4", "Bob", "short"], ["5", "Eric", "very_tall"], ["6", "Arnold", "very_short"]]}}
